**ThermoSim 2026** is a two-day conference dedicated to practical applications of thermal system simulation using Modelica and FMI.  
It brings together engineers, researchers, and industry professionals to exchange experience, discuss current challenges, and present real-world use cases from industry and academia.

The conference takes place every two years and focuses on open dialogue between users, developers, and decision-makers working with modern simulation tools and methods.

#### Event Details

- **Date:** 22–23 September 2026  
- **Location:** Aachen, Germany  
- **Language:** Primarily German  
  (support for English-speaking participants will be available)

#### Topics include

- Industrial applications of system simulation  
- Modelica and FMI in engineering workflows  
- Energy systems, thermal processes, and digital engineering  
- Exchange of practical experience between users and developers  

